<view class="review-page">
  <view class="review-card">
    <view class="review-label">审核专用 · 隔离测试数据</view>
    <view class="review-title">审核账号登录</view>
    <view class="review-note">
      此入口使用独立测试数据，与家人的真实资料分开。审核环境不发送真实微信通知。
    </view>
    <view class="field-label">审核账号</view>
    <input
      class="review-input"
      value="{{username}}"
      maxlength="128"
      placeholder="请输入审核账号"
      bindinput="onUsernameInput"
      disabled="{{busy}}"
    />
    <view class="field-label">审核口令</view>
    <input
      class="review-input"
      value="{{password}}"
      password="{{true}}"
      maxlength="256"
      placeholder="请输入审核专用口令"
      bindinput="onPasswordInput"
      disabled="{{busy}}"
    />
    <view class="review-error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
    <button
      class="review-submit"
      bindtap="submitReviewLogin"
      loading="{{busy}}"
      disabled="{{busy || !username || !password}}"
    >
      登录审核环境
    </button>
    <button class="review-return" bindtap="returnToFamily">返回普通微信入口</button>
    <view class="review-tip">
      请使用开发者提供的审核账号，请勿填写个人微信密码。口令不会保存到本地。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
